---

Note on provenance: the Fletcher/RTM CUDA+MPI application under src/ and
include/ originates from Vinícius Daniel Spadotto's implementation
(https://github.com/Dannful/distributed-cube-average), developed for
Spadotto's own prior work (cited in CITATION.cff and in the accompanying
paper as spadotto2026sbacpad / spadotto2026tcc / spadotto2026carla).
Spadotto is a co-author of the paper this repository accompanies and the
paper's own text commits to releasing this experimental framework
alongside it. This repository is an independently-created artifact
repository (fresh Git history, no fork/clone of the original repository)
containing a curated snapshot of that code plus all validation harness,
analysis, and campaign-orchestration code written for this specific paper.
